## Model card

- **Name:** Ling 3.0 Flash Sante
- **Short description:** InclusionAI's health-and-medicine specialization of Ling 3.0 Flash built for medical reasoning, professional healthcare tasks, deep research and evidence-based retrieval. Hosted-only API variant; no weights published.
- **Provider / access:** Hosted APIs only — Novita AI, Vercel AI Gateway (`inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-sante`). No OpenCode Zen free ID. No Hugging Face / ModelScope repository for the Sante fine-tune.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-09-04 per models.dev; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-sante`
- **Context window:** 262,144 total / 32,768 max output per models.dev / Novita; Vercel lists 256,000 total / 32,000 max output.
- **Modalities:** Text in / text out only; function calling supported per provider listings; no image/audio/video/attachment support.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-27):** $0.075 / 1M input, $0.22 / 1M output (Vercel AI Gateway, Novita); $0.015 / 1M cached read. Launch promotion previously $0/$0 into early October 2026.
- **Architecture:** MoE inherited from Ling 3.0 Flash backbone, 124B total / ~5.1B active per token — per meta.json; Sante fine-tune weights closed, no licence published.

